<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Loscam approves GE bid.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Loscam approves GE bid.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loscam Ltd said on Monday that directors of the transport equipment hire firm believed a takeover bid by GE Capital Services was fair and reasonable.</p>
<p>They said in a statement that Loscam shareholders should accept the 43 cent per share bid in the absence of a higher offer. The bid values Loscam at about A$54 million.</p>
<p>Loscam is controlled by 80.74 percent shareholder Pacific Dunlop Ltd which has said it would accept the bid.</p>
<p>GE Capital Services is a unit of the United States-based General Electric Co. Loscam shares last traded at 43 cents.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
